{"version":1,"key":"card:157","content":{"id":157,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CSS 全称为 Cascading Style Sheets，中文翻译过来为层叠样式表，它可以为标签添加样式，例如改变文字颜色，设置对齐方式等等。添加样式的方法有四种："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"style","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"style","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"link","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"@import","code":true}]}]}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"style 属性"}],"level":2},{"type":"code-block","code":"<body>\n  <h1 style=\"color: red;\">Hello World!</h1>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;\">今天的天气真好</p>\n</body>","language":"HTML","uuid":"e99b2b16-c875-4568-8b50-55ecf743fc91","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"style 标签"}],"level":2},{"type":"code-block","code":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <title>CSS介绍</title>\n    <style>\n        h1 {\n            color: blue; /* 设置一级标题的字体颜色为蓝色*/\n        }\n        p {\n            text-align: right; /* 设置 p 中文本对齐的方式为右对齐 */\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <h1>Hello World!</h1>\n    <p>今天天气真好</p>\n</body>\n</html>","language":"html","uuid":"dc31b042-d133-4912-b67b-010930b65801","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"link 标签"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当网页的规模不大，样式较少时，可以将样式写在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"style","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签中，但是当网页变得复杂，将样式写在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"style","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签不好调试 ，所以我们一般将样式写在一个单独的文件中，然后通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"link","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签引入该样式文件。假设目录结构如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"index.html\nindex.css","language":"","uuid":"393dd6d0-0e43-4da9-b874-af8b8275617c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"index.css 为样式文件，它与 index.html 在同一个文件夹下面，我们现在需要在 index.html 中引入 index.css"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<!-- index.html -->\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <title>link标签</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./index.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <h1>Hello World!</h1>\n    <p>今天天气真好</p>\n</body>\n</html>","language":"html","uuid":"57483ee2-247d-4368-a789-4594ef5b5e09","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"/* index.css */\nh1 {\n    color: orange;\n}\np {\n    font-size: 2em;\n}","language":"css","uuid":"d5d9d96a-ae8d-40cc-8310-ae5f42b428bd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"link","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"href","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性来指明 CSS 文件的位置，浏览器会根据指出的位置下载文件，然后解析该文件，为网页添加样式。"},{"type":"formatted","text":"link","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 所引用的文件不仅仅可以是本地文件，甚至可以是网络文件"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<link href=\"https://cdn.bootcdn.net/ajax/libs/tailwindcss/2.0.4/base.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">","language":"html","uuid":"f6374c4e-7655-4b41-8ebd-e9b0f498f0c6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"rel","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"stylesheet","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它的目的是为了告诉浏览器我引入的是层叠样式表文件，在 HTML5 中，这一属性可以省略。"}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"@import"}],"level":2},{"type":"code-block","code":"<style>\n    @import url(\"index.css\");\n</style>","language":"html","uuid":"80540539-6b20-4255-be59-bf6d1f79438c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除了可以在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"style","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签中通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"@import","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 导入样式文件，还可以在 CSS 文件中使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"@import","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"/* main.css */\n@import \"https://cdn.bootcdn.net/ajax/libs/tailwindcss/2.0.4/base.css\"","language":"css","uuid":"ec5bcb6c-e0cc-4a71-ab07-be1cef7044d8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"@import","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 必须出现在样式规则之前，在样式表之后的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"@import","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将会被忽略。"}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"tip","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"link","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 引入 CSS 文件与通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"@import","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 引入 CSS 文件有何不同?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"二者差别不是很大，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"link","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签是 HTML 引入样式表的机制，而 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"@import","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 CSS 引入样式表的机制。但是浏览器处理他们的方式是不同的，就性能而言，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"link","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签具有明显的优势，所以推荐使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"link","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 引入样式。"}]}]}],"tags":["CSS"],"createTime":1690213996994,"updateTime":1743303640406,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640406}}